129	  /// Whether [e]'s request targeted one of the three `security: []`
130	  /// operations (signup, login, refresh) — the only calls `AUTH_EXPIRED`
131	  /// must never be treated as a mid-session expiry for, since those are the
132	  /// anon-keyed calls Story 1.4's `restoreSession()` itself makes.
133	  ///
134	  /// Mirrors `HeaderInterceptor.onRequest`'s own fail-open behavior: a
135	  /// malformed `requestOptions.path` (shouldn't happen — `UrlBuilder`
136	  /// always produces a valid URL) is treated as "not anon-key-only" rather
137	  /// than letting a `FormatException` escape this mapping step unmapped
138	  /// (RNF09).
139	  bool _isAnonKeyOnlyCall(DioException e) {
140	    String function;
141	    try {
142	      function = HeaderInterceptor.functionNameOf(e.requestOptions.path);
143	    } catch (_) {
144	      function = '';
145	    }
146	    return HeaderInterceptor.anonKeyOnlyFunctions.contains(function);
147	  }
